	<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--body-text-w-image paragraph--view-mode--default">
		  
<div class="xl:max-w-[940px] mx-auto my-9 lg:my-[3.125rem] px-[1.25rem] xl:px-0">

  <div class="flex flex-col">
          <h2>Spread the Word</h2>
    
    <div class="font-urw text-[1.063rem] lg:text-lg float-left text-formatted">
              <img
          src=https://www.ala.org/sites/default/files/styles/body_text_w_image/public/2026-04/260317-oif-bbw26-TOPTEN-wCOVERS-4-square.png.webp?itok=iJK0IxG8
          alt="Top 11 Most Challenged Books of 2025. Collage image featuring 11 different book covers. Protect the Freedom to Read. ALA.org/BBooks. American Library Association"
          width=1080
          height=1080
          class="float-right ml-5 md:ml-10 max-w-full lg:max-w-[437px] max-h-[316px] w-auto m-auto mb-5 md:mb-10"
        />
      
      
                            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><!DOCTYPE html>
<html><body><div>
<h3><strong>Shareable Graphics</strong></h3>
<p><a href="https://www.ala.org/sites/default/files/2026-04/260317-oif-bbw26-TOPTEN-wCOVERS-6-bsbanner.png">Bluesky Cover</a> | <a href="https://www.ala.org/sites/default/files/2026-04/260317-oif-bbw26-TOPTEN-wCOVERS-5-horizontal.png">Horizontal</a> | <a href="https://www.ala.org/sites/default/files/2026-04/260317-oif-bbw26-TOPTEN-wCOVERS-2-igshare_0.png">Instagram Share</a> | <a href="https://www.ala.org/sites/default/files/2026-04/260317-oif-bbw26-TOPTEN-wCOVERS-3-igstory%20%281%29.png">Instagram Story</a> | <a href="https://www.ala.org/sites/default/files/2026-04/260317-oif-bbw26-TOPTEN-wCOVERS-4-square.png">Square</a> &nbsp;</p>
<p>The Top Ten Most Challenged Books of 2025 infographic was released as part of the 2026 <em>State of America's Libraries Report</em>.&nbsp;</p>
<p><a class="primary-button" href="https://www.ala.org/news/state-americas-libraries-report-2026"><strong>View the Full Report</strong></a></p>
</div>
</body></html>
