                    </h3>
                    <div id="accordion-item-94312" class="accordion-item__body hidden pb-9 text-base lg:text-xl" role="region"
                         aria-labelledby="accordion-item-trigger-94312">
                        
                            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><!DOCTYPE html>
<html><body><p>Out of 458 challenges&nbsp;recorded by the Office for Intellectual Freedom, here are the most challenged titles along with the reasons cited for censorship attempts.</p>
<ol>
<li><em><strong>Alice&nbsp;</strong></em><strong>(series), by Phyllis Reynolds Naylor</strong><br>Reasons:&nbsp;sexual content,&nbsp;offensive language, unsuited to age group</li>
