<li><em><strong>Arming America: The Origins of a National Gun Culture</strong></em><strong>, by Michael Bellesiles</strong><br>Reason:&nbsp;inaccuracy</li>
<li><em><strong>Fallen Angels</strong></em><strong>, by Walter Dean Myers</strong>&nbsp;<br>Reason: drugs,&nbsp;offensive language, racism, sexual content,&nbsp;violence</li>
<li><em><strong>Go Ask Alice</strong></em><strong>, by Anonymous</strong>&nbsp;<br>Reason: drugs</li>
<li><em><strong>It's Perfectly Normal</strong></em><strong>, by Robie Harris</strong>&nbsp;<br>Reasons: homosexuality, nudity, sexual content,&nbsp;sex education</li>
<li><em><strong>We All Fall Down</strong></em><strong>, by Robert Cormier</strong>&nbsp;<br>Reasons: offensive language, sexual content</li>
<li><em><strong>King &amp; King</strong></em><strong>, by Linda de Haan</strong>&nbsp;<br>Reason: homosexuality</li>
