</body></html>
</div>
                    
                    </div>
                </div>
                                            
                                <div class="accordion-item border-b">
                    <h3 class="accordion-item__heading text-xl lg:text-2xl my-0">
                        <button id="accordion-item-trigger-94313" class="accordion-item__trigger items-center m-0 text-left text-xl py-5 w-full items-center" type="button"
                                aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-item-94313">
                            Top 10 Most Challenged Books for 2002
                        </button>
                    </h3>
                    <div id="accordion-item-94313" class="accordion-item__body hidden pb-9 text-base lg:text-xl" role="region"
                         aria-labelledby="accordion-item-trigger-94313">
                        
                            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><!DOCTYPE html>
<html><body><p>Out of 515 challenges&nbsp;recorded by the Office for Intellectual Freedom, here are the most challenged titles along with the reasons cited for censorship attempts.</p>
<ol>
